Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.74,0:00:03.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜星光：为了拯救真月 我们将{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.09,0:00:04.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}乘坐异次元飞行船
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.13,0:00:05.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}前往巴利安世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.51,0:00:08.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然而 抵达的地方却是 萨尔加索。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.44,0:00:10.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 在那里看到的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.99,0:00:13.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是真月面目全非的身影。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.94,0:00:17.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}愤怒颤抖的游马与鲨鱼 快斗一起{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.43,0:00:18.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开始与贝库塔他们 决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.72,0:00:22.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 等待着我们的却是…＞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.92,0:00:31.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.65,0:00:35.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)凌牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.58,0:00:37.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底发生了什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.93,0:00:39.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(轨道7)快斗大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.14,0:00:40.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)这是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.33,0:00:42.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场地魔法吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.13,0:00:44.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)没错
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.12,0:00:45.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个地方 场地魔法{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.33,0:00:48.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异次元古战场萨尔加索的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.11,0:00:51.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}早就已经发动了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.57,0:00:53.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什、什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.08,0:00:55.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连这都不知道，还大摇大摆地
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.94,0:00:59.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}登场亮相，甚至还召唤了超量怪兽～。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.02,0:01:01.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然是陷阱吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.09,0:01:03.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝)萨尔加索的效果是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.96,0:01:05.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤怪兽超量时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.70,0:01:08.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到500点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.06,0:01:11.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)还有一个，场上有怪兽超量的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.53,0:01:12.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}玩家{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.17,0:01:14.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每个回合结束时也会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.50,0:01:16.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到500点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.20,0:01:19.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么，这样一来你们三个人都…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.55,0:01:20.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(德之助)确实
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.50,0:01:22.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会吃到500点伤害呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.77,0:01:23.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力)归根结底
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.92,0:01:26.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光是这一回合就要吃1000点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.17,0:01:28.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(海马)原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.37,0:01:30.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是随时伴随伤害风险的决斗吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.34,0:01:33.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.02,0:01:36.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来自我的礼物希望你能喜欢？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.51,0:01:41.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 他们的条件也一样。到底想干什么……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.28,0:01:43.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别开玩笑了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.89,0:01:47.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管有什么陷阱等着我我都绝对要打倒你！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.73,0:01:50.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你对真月…… 对真月……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.10,0:01:52.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我绝对不会原谅你！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.08,0:01:54.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那还真是令人期待……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.59,0:01:56.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.12,0:01:59.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也来给他加油吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.65,0:02:01.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住手～！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.20,0:02:03.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！ 冷静点！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.60,0:02:09.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是被愤怒冲昏了头就正中那家伙的下怀了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.43,0:02:12.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶 我盖一张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.55,0:02:13.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.23,0:02:16.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}盖一张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.49,0:02:19.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(铁男)回合结束了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.26,0:02:20.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}萨尔加索的效果……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.94,0:02:31.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊 蜻蜓和不良泽美！ 卡 海马大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.98,0:02:34.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 银河眼的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.01,0:02:38.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过使用2个超量单元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.61,0:02:40.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从卡组将 银河眼·光子·龙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.35,0:02:43.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.90,0:02:48.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在黑暗中闪耀的银河啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.26,0:02:52.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}化作希望之光寄宿于我的仆从吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.60,0:02:54.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.09,0:02:56.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼·光子·龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.78,0:03:01.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放1张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.36,0:03:05.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海马大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.08,0:03:10.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连海马也！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.83,0:03:13.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然一起受到同样的伤害啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.52,0:03:16.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.58,0:03:18.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 暗影食尸鬼！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.09,0:03:24.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.83,0:03:26.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 发动暗影食尸鬼的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.55,0:03:30.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将这张卡的攻击力将其变为０{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.55,0:03:33.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌将攻击力０的暗影怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.59,0:03:35.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤出来！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.49,0:03:37.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧！ ２只
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.20,0:03:39.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗影·威尔·奥·扎·维斯普！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.16,0:03:40.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.51,0:03:43.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗影·威尔·奥·扎·维斯普的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.70,0:03:46.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在特殊召唤时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.32,0:03:49.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级可以变成与自己１只怪兽相同！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.53,0:03:52.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 等级变为４！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.87,0:03:56.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级４的怪兽有３只。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.76,0:03:57.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.13,0:04:01.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用 等级４的 暗影·古尔和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.52,0:04:03.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}２只 暗影·威尔·奥·扎·维斯普
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.95,0:04:04.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.54,0:04:06.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用３只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.66,0:04:08.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.11,0:04:10.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.55,0:04:13.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来吧！No.104！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.05,0:04:19.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用那耀眼的圣光{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.71,0:04:22.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让愚蠢的蝼蚁们跪伏在地吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.44,0:04:26.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}假面魔导士·闪耀！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.42,0:06:02.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了啊，超百 No.！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.56,0:06:05.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是这样一来那家伙也会因为萨尔加索的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.38,0:06:08.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到500点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.67,0:06:12.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动速攻魔法萨尔加索的灯塔。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.43,0:06:16.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当萨尔加索的效果伤害发生时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.32,0:06:19.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过将这张卡送去墓地
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.58,0:06:21.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使那个效果无效{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.58,0:06:24.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且，只要这张卡在墓地存在{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.06,0:06:27.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就不会受到萨尔加索的效果影响！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.35,0:06:28.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎 怎么会。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.29,0:06:30.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然事先准备好了防卫手段。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.59,0:06:36.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么，每到回合结束时
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.42,0:06:38.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到伤害的就只有游马他们了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.21,0:06:40.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯西)那样也太狡猾了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.85,0:06:45.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就用这 沙尔加索 折磨你好好痛苦吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.55,0:06:50.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！ 闪耀。攻击希望皇霍普。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.19,0:06:52.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}休想得逞！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.73,0:06:55.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动霍普的效果 月光屏障！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.22,0:06:59.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蠢货！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.74,0:07:00.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.94,0:07:02.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动闪耀的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.22,0:07:05.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用一个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.76,0:07:08.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对手怪兽在战斗中发动的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.85,0:07:09.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.68,0:07:13.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 而且 作为豪华附赠{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.44,0:07:16.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给对手玩家 800点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.47,0:07:18.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.58,0:07:25.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完！ 霍普的效果无效。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.62,0:07:27.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}继续闪耀的攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.23,0:07:30.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动陷阱！ 半不破！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.32,0:07:33.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 将战斗中的怪兽破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.87,0:07:34.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效化{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.88,0:07:38.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将玩家受到的伤害减半。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.84,0:07:43.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎呀哎呀 挺顽强的嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.53,0:07:48.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《只要把霍普留下来就能出霍普雷V…》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.52,0:07:51.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘛 不过留下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.61,0:07:53.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反倒更有意思就是了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.52,0:07:58.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖一张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.55,0:08:02.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看着吧！我一定要像上次一样{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.37,0:08:03.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把你打得落花流水！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.67,0:08:04.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.29,0:08:07.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我绝对要赢为真月报仇！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.22,0:08:09.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冷静点 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.79,0:08:10.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}少罗嗦！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.57,0:08:12.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你能明白我的心情吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.52,0:08:15.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月都是因为我…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.47,0:08:17.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.90,0:08:22.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝)我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.47,0:08:25.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 圣光机翼！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.51,0:08:32.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 发动机翼的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.85,0:08:35.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡召唤成功的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.45,0:08:39.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从手牌将 圣光机械怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.11,0:08:40.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只 特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.94,0:08:44.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！ 圣光机械雄牛！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.79,0:08:47.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样就是第2只了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.66,0:08:50.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多尔贝)进一步 发动雄牛的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.52,0:08:54.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1回合一次 从手牌将魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.23,0:08:55.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1张送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.27,0:08:58.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将手牌的圣光机械怪兽1只
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.88,0:09:00.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.83,0:09:03.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}送去墓地的卡是 萨尔加索的灯塔。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.45,0:09:08.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}｡\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 从手牌将 圣光机械剑\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.03,0:09:14.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙也 把萨尔加索的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.89,0:09:16.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效化的卡…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.54,0:09:18.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真够脏的啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.26,0:09:21.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}随你怎么说。 我也
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.29,0:09:23.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}必须救巴利安！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.01,0:09:24.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}救？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.79,0:09:27.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不必找借口{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.70,0:09:30.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对凌牙来说 正好我觉得是恰到好处的惩罚呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.80,0:09:31.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.00,0:09:33.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 正是如此。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.37,0:09:37.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 凌牙 我就不客气了让我来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.56,0:09:40.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级4的光辉闪电之翼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.61,0:09:42.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}书剑 超量！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.69,0:09:44.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以3只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.67,0:09:46.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.10,0:09:48.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.56,0:09:56.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝)现身吧 No.102。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.76,0:10:00.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光辉闪电 荣耀光环。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.29,0:10:05.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.69,0:10:09.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 终于来了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.18,0:10:11.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.91,0:10:15.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我在对方场上攻击力2000以上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.05,0:10:16.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当我方场上有攻击力2000以上的怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.43,0:10:19.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将这只怪兽特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.55,0:10:24.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，限界龙 舒瓦尔茨希尔特。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.54,0:10:28.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《等级８》
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.22,0:10:31.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且，当我方场上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.01,0:10:33.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有等级８的怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.66,0:10:36.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无需解放，召唤星间龙 帕尔塞克。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.38,0:10:42.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用等级８的舒瓦尔茨希尔特和帕尔塞克
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.89,0:10:43.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行叠放。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.73,0:10:47.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用２只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.00,0:10:49.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.98,0:10:51.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.22,0:10:55.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}显现吧，No.107。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.00,0:11:00.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼时空龙。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.47,0:11:13.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙，难道没有
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.91,0:11:15.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效伤害的卡吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.70,0:11:17.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，当然有。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.63,0:11:21.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但那种东西是胆小鬼才用的卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.57,0:11:25.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不跟你用同样的条件赢的话就没有意义。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.99,0:11:30.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是真正的银河眼使用者究竟是谁{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.42,0:11:32.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一场决出雌雄的崇高战斗正因为如此。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.77,0:11:34.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.67,0:11:38.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.95,0:11:42.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.93,0:11:44.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动升级魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.21,0:11:46.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}限制型巴利安之力。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.45,0:11:47.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.76,0:11:49.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为、为什么要阻止我？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.03,0:11:51.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤混沌超量的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.69,0:11:54.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会因为萨尔加索的效果失去生命值。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.89,0:11:56.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可就算这样，再继续下去的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.39,0:11:59.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每回合结束时都会失去500点。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.03,0:12:03.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里就用希望皇V一举决出胜负。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.52,0:12:06.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是游马，这场决斗有什么不对劲。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.14,0:12:07.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不对劲？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.19,0:12:08.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.40,0:12:11.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全都是像是在引诱我们的发展。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.26,0:12:14.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和之前战斗过的贝库塔明显不同。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.46,0:12:18.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿斯特拉尔，要是在这里退缩的话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.00,0:12:19.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月就死不瞑目了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.80,0:12:22.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冷静下来，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.26,0:12:22.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吵死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.50,0:12:26.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么好像吵起来了，乌拉？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.75,0:12:29.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总觉得两个人的配合完全对不上啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.88,0:12:31.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动升阶魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.49,0:12:33.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}限定型异晶之力。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.54,0:12:35.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.65,0:12:37.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是将超量怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.72,0:12:39.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进化成混沌超量。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.48,0:12:42.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用希望皇霍普
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.26,0:12:44.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重构超量网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.04,0:12:48.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量变换。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.02,0:12:52.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在正是你现身之时 CNo.39。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.98,0:12:54.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇 霍普雷V。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.17,0:13:05.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普雷V。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.24,0:13:07.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(大家)来了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.51,0:13:09.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了吗 霍普雷V。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.83,0:13:10.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.34,0:13:11.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你为此
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.27,0:13:13.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要承受500点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.80,0:13:19.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.44,0:13:25.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦 我发动 霍普雷V的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.28,0:13:27.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1回合1次
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.19,0:13:29.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用混沌超量单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.80,0:13:31.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏场上的1只怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.33,0:13:35.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并将那只怪兽攻击力数值的伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.29,0:13:36.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予对手。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.06,0:13:38.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.35,0:13:43.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的仇 我一定会替你报。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.89,0:13:47.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 霍普雷V。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.82,0:13:50.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将闪光斩碎。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.65,0:13:53.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑 V字斩。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.64,0:13:56.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闪光是 在战斗中 只能无效
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.01,0:13:57.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方怪兽的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.08,0:14:06.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(大家)太好了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.88,0:14:09.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 只要直接攻击成功
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.03,0:14:09.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马就赢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.84,0:14:11.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等一下。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.00,0:14:16.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是怎么回事！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.11,0:14:19.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙…贝库塔他…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.62,0:14:21.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔消失了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.11,0:14:25.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道被刚才的攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.13,0:14:27.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打飞到异空间去了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.58,0:14:29.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.45,0:14:31.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那我算是赢了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.55,0:14:34.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.81,0:14:36.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是真月…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.86,0:14:39.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月已经
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.81,0:14:41.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回不来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.07,0:14:50.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(真月)谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.37,0:14:53.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.13,0:14:55.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.99,0:15:02.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月？你这家伙……你这家伙……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.04,0:15:04.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你还活着吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.77,0:15:07.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.74,0:15:12.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你还活着啊，真月！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.75,0:15:25.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}骗～你的啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.68,0:15:26.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真、真月？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.96,0:15:32.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}笑死我了，肚子都疼了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.59,0:15:34.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在说什么……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.71,0:15:36.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙可真有意思啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.16,0:15:39.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的把我……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.20,0:15:43.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那要不要让你看看？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.67,0:15:46.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}更有意思的东西！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.99,0:15:52.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}屏障之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.46,0:15:54.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.30,0:16:01.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.14,0:16:18.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.47,0:16:20.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.52,0:16:25.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这混蛋，居然变成真月的样子！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.97,0:16:28.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那好吧，真正的真月在哪！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.24,0:16:31.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}本尊？那是谁啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.87,0:16:34.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 是贝库塔。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.51,0:16:37.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真迟钝啊 我才是真月哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.97,0:16:38.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会这样！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.26,0:16:40.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 刚才明明
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.31,0:16:42.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔还在和我决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.53,0:16:43.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}之前也是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.45,0:16:46.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔和我决斗 还把真月给……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.17,0:16:49.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还不明白吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.80,0:16:52.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}之前决斗的那个
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.34,0:16:54.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和刚才一直决斗的那个{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.14,0:16:57.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都是我创造出来的分身哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.97,0:17:01.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真正的我 一直伪装成你的挚友
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.08,0:17:03.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月零啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.34,0:17:06.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}锵锵锵～！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.37,0:17:09.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在即将揭晓的冲击真相。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.67,0:17:12.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎呀～ 真是辛苦死我了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.67,0:17:16.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}演那个蠢蛋转校生还陪你们搞那些无聊的合作。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.28,0:17:18.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎 怎么会……。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.11,0:17:20.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月是巴利安！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.10,0:17:23.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然用这种卑鄙手段。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.20,0:17:26.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过你还真是单纯啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.32,0:17:29.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从我嘴里说出的假话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.53,0:17:31.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你全都信了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.74,0:17:35.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}守护星光界～？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.79,0:17:37.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安警察？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.94,0:17:44.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还挺开心的和你玩这场友情过家家。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.45,0:17:47.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢谢你特地来救我，辛苦了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.83,0:17:48.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马巡查！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.70,0:17:52.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别开玩笑了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.64,0:17:55.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你怎么可能是真月！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.73,0:17:57.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙…那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.60,0:17:58.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才不是会骗人的家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.65,0:18:02.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那我就告诉你吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.17,0:18:05.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的卡组里有着我和你的友情证明
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.68,0:18:08.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的巴利安卡就在里面吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.79,0:18:12.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((这张卡 先交给你))
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.63,0:18:15.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.40,0:18:18.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马难道你早就知道了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.25,0:18:21.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月是巴利安这件事！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.32,0:18:23.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.54,0:18:27.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体 那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.87,0:18:33.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说不出口吧。以坚固友情相连的重要挚友{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.64,0:18:37.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}毕竟是真月的请求嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.38,0:18:40.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.96,0:18:46.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马… 星光体…。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.93,0:18:49.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)谢了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.43,0:18:50.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遵守了和我的约定{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.79,0:18:52.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对大家保密这件事。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.30,0:18:58.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.52,0:19:01.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用希望皇进行直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.31,0:19:03.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.61,0:19:07.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么我发动永续陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.87,0:19:10.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Vain 背叛的嘲笑！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.31,0:19:13.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}名字带有V的怪兽攻击过来的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.11,0:19:16.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那次攻击与效果无效{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.03,0:19:20.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把对方卡组中名字带有V的卡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.44,0:19:21.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部送去墓地！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.65,0:19:28.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 从对方卡组或手牌中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.03,0:19:31.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}名字带有V的卡被送去墓地时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.96,0:19:34.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每1张V卡恢复500点
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.65,0:19:36.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己的生命值。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.02,0:19:39.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被送去墓地的卡有5张。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.52,0:19:42.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此我恢复2500点生命值！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.48,0:19:47.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连找回失去的生命值的手段
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.85,0:19:49.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都已经准备好了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.23,0:19:52.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完！ 而且而且{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.49,0:19:54.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每1张被送去墓地的V卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.11,0:19:58.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从对方卡组中将5张卡送去墓地。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.43,0:20:01.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1张换5张！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.00,0:20:02.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.96,0:20:06.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.46,0:20:11.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马的卡有25张进墓地了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.31,0:20:14.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不止25张
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.72,0:20:17.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把V卡全算上的话就是30张！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.53,0:20:20.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}卡组破坏吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.62,0:20:22.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}卡组破坏……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.24,0:20:25.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}剩下的卡只有3张。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.48,0:20:28.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当无法抽卡的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.80,0:20:31.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就意味着决斗的败北。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.07,0:20:33.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我才不会让你来个痛快。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.86,0:20:35.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要让你慢慢受折磨。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.46,0:20:37.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.15,0:20:40.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特意连自己的分身都准备好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.19,0:20:41.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和游马决斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.15,0:20:44.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从一开始就是为了这个目的吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.49,0:20:45.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.29,0:20:47.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正因为是游马{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.92,0:20:50.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我觉得从我这里得到的卡作为友情的证明{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.05,0:20:53.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定会放进卡组里。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.91,0:20:54.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.68,0:20:57.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要让真月以为是我干的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.52,0:20:59.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他就会血气上头{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.55,0:21:03.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一口气把王牌打出来，我是这么想的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.33,0:21:06.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙 真是让人痛快地
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.94,0:21:08.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}按我想的动啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.48,0:21:14.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太棒了 太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.08,0:21:17.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.28,0:21:22.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.31,0:21:26.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 就剩三张卡了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.41,0:21:28.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你打算怎么办啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.05,0:21:31.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}尽管挣扎给我看吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.14,0:21:35.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反正所有人 都别想活着从这里出去。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.98,0:21:40.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这一切的一切 游马都是你招来的结果！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.25,0:21:43.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连无关的人都卷进来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.34,0:21:47.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我？ 是我 把大家…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.93,0:21:50.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在你看来 也许是出于好意
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.71,0:21:53.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然你大概觉得是为了大家好！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.26,0:22:01.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.42,0:23:43.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.08,0:23:45.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.25,0:23:46.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.77,0:23:49.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.84,0:23:52.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.79,0:23:54.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
